  "description": "<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"515\">De <strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"126\">Native Instruments Komplete Kontrol S25</strong> is een hoogwaardige en expressieve <strong data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"181\">MIDI controller</strong>, ontworpen voor producers en muzikanten die naadloos willen werken met software-instrumenten en DAW’s. Dankzij de uitstekende integratie met <strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"335\">Komplete</strong>, NKS-compatibele plug-ins en populaire muzieksoftware werk je sneller en intuïtiever. Het compacte formaat maakt de S25 ideaal voor studio’s met beperkte ruimte of mobiele setups.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"600\">De MIDI controller verkeert in <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"566\">In Nette Staat</strong> en is technisch volledig in orde.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"622\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n<li data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"668\">🎹 Hoogwaardige toetsen met fijne aanslag</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"721\">\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"721\">🎛️ Diepe integratie met Komplete & NKS-plug-ins</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"770\">💡 LED-feedback en touch-sensitive bediening</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"815\">🎶 Ideaal voor studio- en thuisproductie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"842\">📋 <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"842\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n<li data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"871\">Merk: Native Instruments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"903\">\r\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"903\">Model: Komplete Kontrol S25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"929\">Type: MIDI controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"952\">Aantal toetsen: 25</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"978\">Toetsen: Synth-action</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1015\">Compatibiliteit: Windows & macOS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1036\">Aansluiting: USB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1077\">Toepassing: Muziekproductie / studio</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1103\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1128\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1128\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1188\">Native Instruments Komplete Kontrol S25 MIDI controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1256\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1217\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">Incl. Garantie: <strong>3 maand garantie</strong></p>",
